{"id":"5044","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5044_main_cumulus-congestus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片显示中等垂直范围的内积云的特别凸起芽状。它有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">清晰的轮廓，明亮的白色云顶</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">深色的水平云底</span>，这是浓云云种的特征。凸出的上部<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">类似于花椰菜</span>。这张照片中的云正处于一个成长阶段，很快就会产生一场雷雨。从云底飘落的阵雨是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水性</span>附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kairo Kiitsak","location":"爱沙尼亚Simuna","latitude":"纬度: 59° 2' 43'' N","longitude":"经度: 26° 24' 3'' E","date":"15 July 2014 1859 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5044_syn_cumulus-congestus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>0000 UTC天气图显示1008 hPa的浅低压位于爱沙尼亚西部，白天向该国的东部移动。雷暴在不稳定的气团中形成。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4766_main_cumulus-congestus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>积云通常是密集的，具有清晰轮廓，以上升的山丘、圆顶或塔等的形式垂直发展。积云通常是分离的云；虽然无法确定这张图像中的这些云是否分离，但是在海岸外的海面上的阴影表明主要细胞有一定程度的分离。它们还有非常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色阳光照射部分</span>；相对<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">较暗且近水平的云底</span>；与积云有关的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强垂直范围</span>。值得注意的是，强烈的萌芽、清晰的轮廓和凸起的上部，类似于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>的花椰菜，决定了其为浓云云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"15 September 2015 1406 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3"}]}]}